## Program Outcome

App Server is the durable first opportunity for eligible Tool Shed work only after explicit owner
opt-in. Preference recovery remains explicit, validation traffic is isolated from runtime evidence,
the opportunity funnel is locally reportable, fallback remains safe, and the released behavior is
proven across supported installs and reconciled back to IDEA-0010.

